#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum-safe cryptography skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Lege eine 20-Fragen-Prüfung auf der IBM Training-Website ab, um deine Kenntnisse in quantensicherer Kryptographie zu testen, und erhalte ein Badge über Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography"
msgstr "Prüfung | Praktische Einführung in die quantensichere Kryptographie"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
